    "description": "Natural Mineral Specimens\nComprehensive Geological & Decorative Rock Collection\nNatural Crystal, Polished Agate, and Identified Mineral Set\nLargest piece approx. 9\" x 8\" | Total weight 8 lbs\nNatural Specimens\nThis diverse geological collection features a substantial white crystal cluster exhibiting complex geometric terminations and a rugged natural matrix. Complementing the central specimen is a polished blue agate slice with concentric banding and a central crystalline pocket. The lot includes a vintage educational mineral set containing twenty distinct specimens-such as Obsidian, Petrified Wood, and Fluorite-each accompanied by descriptive geological data. An extensive assortment of raw and tumbled gemstones in various colors and textures provides a broad survey of mineralogy suitable for display or study.\nIdentification set includes specimens from regional locales including Arizona, Brazil, and Colorado.\nLarge crystal cluster showcases prominent tabular crystal growth and lustrous surfaces.\nAgate slice features a vibrant teal-dyed hue highlighting the natural chalcedony layers.\nCollection includes a wide variety of silicate and carbonate minerals in tumbled and raw forms.\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition. Natural mineral specimens show expected inclusions, varied textures, and minor surface friability inherent to their geological formation. The identification box and key show light shelf wear consistent with age but remain fully legible and intact. Agate slice and tumbled stones are well-polished.\nWarehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
